description = "A player-founded place: a Hearth, a claimed circle of land, members with roles and a shared Stockpile. It grows from founded to growing to town as members and days accumulate, and is abandoned when no member is active; an abandoned claim decays until the land is free again. A claim never covers another settlement's land. Rule changes are made through GovernanceSystem proposals."
